menu "Scanner Hardware Options"

    config SCANNER_NRF24
        bool "Enable NRF24L01 2.4 GHz radio support"
        default n
        help
            Enable optional NRF24L01 2.4 GHz radio support for the scanner.
            When enabled, the firmware initializes an NRF24L01 module on the
            ESP32 VSPI pins and exposes a full-band spectrum scan API. Leave
            this disabled for scanner builds that do not have NRF24 hardware
            attached.

endmenu
